      <chord name="Cm"/>Give, and to you shall be given -<br/>
      <chord name="G"/>God <chord name="G7"/>His beloved <chord name="Cm"/>Son gave;<br/>
      <chord name="Fm"/>Gratefully seeking <chord name="Cm"/>to serve Him,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Give <chord name="F"/>Him <chord name="F7"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>best <chord name="F7"/>that <chord name="Bb7"/>you have.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Eb"/>Give <chord name="Bb7"/>of your <chord name="Eb"/>best to <chord name="Bb7"/>the Master,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>Naught <chord name="Bb7"/>else <chord name="Eb"/>is <chord name="F7"/>worthy <chord name="Bb"/>His love;<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>He <chord name="Bb7"/>gave Himself <chord name="Eb"/>for <chord name="Edim6"/>your ransom,<br/>
      <chord name="Fm"/>Have <chord name="Bb"/>up <chord name="Bb7"/>His <chord name="Eb"/>glory above;<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>Laid down His life without murmur,<br/>
      <chord name="G"/>You from <chord name="G7"/>sin&#x27;s ruin <chord name="Cm"/>to save;<br/>
      <chord name="Fm"/>Give Him <chord name="Cm"/>your heart&#x27;s adoration,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Give <chord name="F"/>Him <chord name="F7"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>best <chord name="F7"/>that <chord name="Bb7"/>you have.
